--
--   **The statement**, as published (namespace `OAI.KadisonKastler`):
--
--   ```lean
--   theorem constructed_finiteFactor_completelyBounded
--       (M : VonNeumannAlgebra H) (hM : Generator.IsII1Factor M.toStarSubalgebra)
